                    "copy": "© 2023 Forge Reply s.r.l. Soulstice and all signs included are trademarks of Forge Reply s.r.l.  Published by Maximum Entertainment™. Maximum Entertainment™ is a registered trademark of Maximum Entertainment, LLC. All rights reserved. All other trademarks or registered trademarks belong to their respective owners.",
